WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.244 --> 00:00:14.727
"Zann! Is really you?"

2
00:00:15.187 --> 00:00:15.868
Zann turned.

3
00:00:16.648 --> 00:00:20.469
A teenage girl he'd never seen before was rushing toward him, grinning widely.

4
00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:22.630
"Uh-oh," Perda whispered.

5
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.710
"It's another fan!"

6
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.131
"Perda!" the girl exclaimed.

7
00:00:27.871 --> 00:00:30.712
She noticed Zann's pet dragon sniffing at a beetle nearby.

8
00:00:32.924 --> 00:00:33.404
"And Zing!

9
00:00:33.424 --> 00:00:35.405
Oh wow—it's an honor to meet you all!"

10
00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:37.826
The girl rubbed her hands together.

11
00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:41.428
Flowers rained down on the street all around them.

12
00:00:41.448 --> 00:00:45.829
"They're beautiful," Perda said politely, catching one of the blossoms.

13
00:00:45.849 --> 00:00:46.950
"Thank you."

14
00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:48.670
The girl beamed.

15
00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:50.551
"No, thank you!

16
00:00:51.392 --> 00:00:53.072
You guys saved Magica!"

17
00:00:53.773 --> 00:00:56.554
A few passing pedestrians stopped to see what was going on.

18
00:00:57.474 --> 00:00:59.735
"Look, son," a man told a little boy.

19
00:00:59.755 --> 00:01:02.528
"It's Zann and Perda.

20
00:01:02.548 --> 00:01:03.389
They're heroes!"

21
00:01:04.589 --> 00:01:07.250
Zann forced a smile as the little boy stared up at him.

22
00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:11.532
It had been less than two days since the grand ceremony celebrating Morb's defeat.

23
00:01:12.192 --> 00:01:16.254
But Zann and his friends were already getting used to attracting attention everywhere they went.

24
00:01:17.154 --> 00:01:21.036
Still, Zann felt a little uncomfortable whenever someone called him a hero.

25
00:01:21.056 --> 00:01:24.617
"We just did what we had to do," he mumbled.

26
00:01:25.678 --> 00:01:31.120
Several people chuckled or clapped their hands to create puffs of colorful magic energy or pretty sparkles.

27
00:01:31.976 --> 00:01:36.700
Zann wondered what his fans would think if they knew he sometimes still thought about Morb's offer.

28
00:01:37.401 --> 00:01:43.086
Zann knew he'd done the right thing by refusing the offer—if he hadn't, Morb would now control Magica.

29
00:01:44.006 --> 00:01:48.610
But Zann still couldn't help wondering Did Morb really know where Zann's parents were?

30
00:01:49.571 --> 00:01:52.614
By now a small crowd had gathered around Zann and Perda.

31
00:01:53.254 --> 00:01:56.017
Thinking about Morb's offer had reminded Zann of today's errand.

32
00:01:56.037 --> 00:01:58.239
"Excuse us," he said.

33
00:01:58.259 --> 00:01:59.580
"We have to get going."

34
00:02:00.388 --> 00:02:01.969
"Of course, of course."

35
00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.610
An older woman beamed at him.

36
00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:07.733
"I'm sure heroes like you have lots of important things to do."

37
00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:10.475
Zann smiled weakly and then hurried off.

38
00:02:11.235 --> 00:02:12.296
Perda and Zing followed.

39
00:02:13.437 --> 00:02:14.498
"Slow down!"

40
00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:16.799
Perda complained as they raced around a corner.

41
00:02:16.819 --> 00:02:20.822
"Otherwise I'll have to use an Acceleration spell to keep up!"

42
00:02:21.622 --> 00:02:24.064
"Sorry." Zann slowed his pace slightly.

43
00:02:24.084 --> 00:02:26.205
"But there's no time to waste.

44
00:02:26.926 --> 00:02:29.808
Who knows how much longer we'll get to stay in First City?"

45
00:02:30.476 --> 00:02:32.217
Perda made a face at the mention of leaving.

46
00:02:32.237 --> 00:02:37.000
"We're lucky the king and queen asked Boz and Gliss' parents to stay for a few days.

47
00:02:38.201 --> 00:02:42.604
Otherwise we'd already be back to our regular lives in boring old Swamp Bottom."

48
00:02:42.624 --> 00:02:46.366
"Yeah." Zann was a little surprised by Perda's words.

49
00:02:47.087 --> 00:02:51.069
Before their adventures had started, Perda seemed content to live in Swamp Bottom.

50
00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.732
Zann was the one who had always complained about how boring the town was.

51
00:02:55.456 --> 00:02:59.099
They passed a wall on which someone had scribbled "Voids are Magicians too!"

52
00:02:59.519 --> 00:03:00.320
in large letters.

53
00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.681
Perda glanced at the graffiti.

54
00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:06.884
"Looks like the Void Rights group has been here," she commented.

55
00:03:06.904 --> 00:03:09.266
"At least their messages are polite.

56
00:03:10.027 --> 00:03:13.289
Some of the ones from the new anti-Red groups are pretty rude."

57
00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.391
Zann nodded, but he wasn't really listening.

58
00:03:17.052 --> 00:03:18.653
They'd just reached the university.

59
00:03:18.673 --> 00:03:24.564
"My parents' old lab is this way," he told Perda.

60
00:03:24.584 --> 00:03:26.565
A young woman looked up when they entered the building.

61
00:03:27.426 --> 00:03:30.407
A nameplate on her desk said "Elbi."

62
00:03:30.427 --> 00:03:32.809
"Oh! It's two of the young heroes!"

63
00:03:33.269 --> 00:03:33.929
she exclaimed.

64
00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.851
Zing spurted out a small blast of flame.

65
00:03:37.591 --> 00:03:42.214
Elbi yanked a potted melody plant out of the way just in time to keep it from getting

66
00:03:42.294 --> 00:03:44.695
singed. "And the dragon."

67
00:03:44.715 --> 00:03:47.877
Elbi narrowed her eyes at Zing and frowned.

68
00:03:47.897 --> 00:03:50.219
"Hi," Zann said.

69
00:03:50.239 --> 00:03:52.580
"My parents used to run this lab.

70
00:03:53.352 --> 00:03:55.253
Their names are Nax and Asta.

71
00:03:55.754 --> 00:03:56.494
Did you know them?"

72
00:03:56.514 --> 00:03:58.255
"Sorry, no."

73
00:03:58.636 --> 00:03:59.276
Elbi shrugged.

74
00:03:59.296 --> 00:04:03.739
"I've heard of them, of course, but I only started working here two years ago."

75
00:04:03.759 --> 00:04:06.981
"Oh. Well, is Olpa around?"

76
00:04:07.001 --> 00:04:12.665
"No. Olpa and the other senior researchers are all at some big meeting at the palace.

77
00:04:13.406 --> 00:04:14.887
I'm not sure when they'll be back.

78
00:04:15.287 --> 00:04:16.768
Should I tell Olpa you were here?"

79
00:04:17.889 --> 00:04:18.869
Zann was disappointed.

80
00:04:18.889 --> 00:04:22.252
"Are you sure there's nobody here who knew my parents?"

81
00:04:23.156 --> 00:04:24.157
Elbi looked sympathetic.

82
00:04:24.557 --> 00:04:27.679
"Sorry. But listen, I have an idea.

83
00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.381
Would you like to see their storage shelf?"

84
00:04:30.822 --> 00:04:31.362
She stood up.

85
00:04:32.003 --> 00:04:36.166
"When your parents disappeared, someone put their things there for safekeeping."

86
00:04:36.186 --> 00:04:37.927
"That would be great!"

87
00:04:38.367 --> 00:04:39.668
Zann felt a surge of hope.

88
00:04:40.389 --> 00:04:43.211
Could there be clues to his parents' whereabouts on that shelf?

89
00:04:44.872 --> 00:04:46.193
Elbi led the way through the lab.

90
00:04:46.834 --> 00:04:50.452
Being back there after so long felt strange to Zann.

91
00:04:50.472 --> 00:04:53.293
Many things looked the same, but others looked very different.

92
00:04:54.133 --> 00:04:55.834
Only a few people were in the main room.

93
00:04:56.554 --> 00:04:59.135
A couple of university students were reading near the bookshelves.

94
00:04:59.955 --> 00:05:01.895
A Void was cleaning a nibbler's cage.

95
00:05:02.736 --> 00:05:05.916
A young researcher was studying a bubbling beaker and scribbling notes.

96
00:05:05.936 --> 00:05:09.017
"Wow, this place is cool!"

97
00:05:09.277 --> 00:05:12.078
Perda whispered to Zann, looking around with wide eyes.

98
00:05:12.098 --> 00:05:14.839
"It must be amazing to work here!"

99
00:05:14.859 --> 00:05:18.120
"Yeah, I guess," said Zann, distracted.

100
00:05:18.816 --> 00:05:21.037
He followed Elbi as she opened a closet door.

101
00:05:21.057 --> 00:05:26.619
"It's the middle shelf in the back," Elbi said, rubbing her fingers together to create a light.

102
00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.761
As soon as Zann saw the shelf, he was flooded with memories.

103
00:05:31.481 --> 00:05:33.322
There was his mother's favorite hair clip.

104
00:05:33.582 --> 00:05:34.642
His father's lab coat.

105
00:05:35.403 --> 00:05:38.804
Even a dragon-shaped paperweight that Zann had given his parents as a gift.

106
00:05:38.824 --> 00:05:40.205
"What's this?"

107
00:05:40.645 --> 00:05:42.566
Perda picked up a large metal sculpture.

108
00:05:43.286 --> 00:05:46.587
It was so blackened by fire that the edges were crumbling away.

109
00:05:46.607 --> 00:05:49.252
"I don't know," Zann said.

110
00:05:49.272 --> 00:05:51.094
"I've never seen it before."

111
00:05:51.114 --> 00:05:55.656
"It looks kind of like Teplo's pet sniffer goose, doesn't it?"

112
00:05:56.016 --> 00:05:56.537
Perda said.

113
00:05:57.217 --> 00:06:01.359
Before Zann could answer, there was an enormous explosion from somewhere in the city.

114
00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.702
The building shook, causing some books to fall from the bookshelf.

115
00:06:06.022 --> 00:06:07.443
Everyone shouted in surprise.

116
00:06:08.243 --> 00:06:15.047
Zann froze, immediately thinking of Morb and the evil Void's final words: Magica hasn't seen the last of

117
00:06:15.107 --> 00:06:15.247
me!
